{"game": "earth-defense-force-5", "language": "english", "appid": 1007040, "month": "2022-06", "window": 1, "start_date": 1654041600, "end_date": 1654646399, "month_true_total": 57, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-28 17:51:59 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "116636091", "author": {"steamid": "76561197970363210", "personaname": "knootewoot", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197970363210/", "num_games_owned": 351, "num_reviews": 76, "playtime_forever": 3901, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 933, "last_played": 1756236998, "avatar": "6b1940e5c6a1432294acf13e4ea78a0d41411f94"}, "language": "english", "review": "I never heard of this game, until some people were playing it at a LAN party.\n\nThe first levels, i thought.... meh\n\nAfter a few, and getting some gear, i shouted EDF each time i started a mission.\n\nI love the hordes of monsters i can shoot with a huge arsenal of weapons with 4 distinctive classes.\n\nPro's:\n- Lots of enemies\n- HUGE environments\n- Lots of AI teammates\n- Great music\n- Fun to play\n- Destructable buildings\n- 4 player co-op\n- Solo mode is also fun if you don't like multiplayer\n- Vehicles\n- 100+ missions (i read) Im at mission 34 or something and have more hours in it already then most new boring shooters\n\nCon's for graphic nerds:\n- Graphics a bit outdated (I don't care that much about graphics myself but if you do, better wait a year or so for EDF6)\n\nCon's\n- Helicopter controls\n\nEDF\n\nEdit: typos (a lot)", "timestamp_created": 1654616335, "timestamp_updated": 1654616394, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.477447211742401123", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "116635837", "author": {"steamid": "76561198002909892", "personaname": "miji", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/pizzababy/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 20, "playtime_forever": 11254, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 8849, "last_played": 1720100396, "avatar": "b06b25a506e6034df508be4f763fb6b93412b291"}, "language": "english", "review": "If you truly love games, you'll wish you'd played this sooner.\nJust when you think you've seen & experienced it all, you'll be exposed to another reason to go OMG!! :O\n\nEntire cities are destructible, giant insects, explosives, air strikes, tanks, mechs, motorcycles with mounted guns...\n...and that's literally just the tip of the iceberg.", "timestamp_created": 1654615998, "timestamp_updated": 1654615998, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 8, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.556970119476318359", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "116615727", "author": {"steamid": "76561198091637923", "personaname": "jeffreymac", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198091637923/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 174826, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7648, "last_played": 1783920163, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Earth defense best game ever", "timestamp_created": 1654577982, "timestamp_updated": 1654577982, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "116615149", "author": {"steamid": "76561198042286392", "personaname": "squirrelmasquerade", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198042286392/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 2473, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1868, "last_played": 1709440525, "avatar": "d113fa8990be71b107e61f5b1832ad6d232031cb"}, "language": "english", "review": "If you want a game/series you'll spend hours yelling and laughing at this is your game. Grab a buddy or three and buckle up. The campaign starts out slow. Don't let the tutorial make you think this game is anything but balls to the walls fun. \nAnd then when you think the fun is over, start a new game on harder difficulties. Or even play the dlc missions which will have you screaming in frustration.\nJust buy it.", "timestamp_created": 1654576440, "timestamp_updated": 1654576440, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "116577690", "author": {"steamid": "76561198203163389", "personaname": "RoboWolf96", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/RoboWolf96/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 42, "playtime_forever": 4128, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 797, "last_played": 1780689374, "avatar": "5fbf86f8921b293c7375c619af03dd4266cb245b"}, "language": "english", "review": "Best EDF yet.", "timestamp_created": 1654526255, "timestamp_updated": 1654526255, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.492957741022109985", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}]}